      "widgets_values": [
        "Supply your own starting_image.png and control_video.mp4. Use matching dimensions divisible by 128 and a video of 9 to 257 frames with an 8n+1 count. The native video fps drives sampling and playback. For precomputed depth or edge guides, connect GetVideoComponents directly to control_frames. The model loader requires ComfyUI-LTXVideo-mlx and the v0.18.0 backend overrides documented in the README. Models must already be cached. Generation quality and memory use have not been tested."
